desktop-entry-confirm-install-desktop-entry = This adds a launcher for the dashboard to your application menu. It does not install or start the background service.
service-confirm-install = This copies the Syntra application and service binaries to the installed location and creates the user service definition. It does not start the dashboard.
service-confirm-uninstall = This removes the installed user service definition. The background daemon may continue until stopped.
service-confirm-start = This starts the installed background service.
service-confirm-stop = This stops the background service and interrupts input and clipboard sharing.
service-confirm-enable = This enables the background service to start with your graphical session.
service-confirm-disable = This disables automatic service startup; it can still be started manually.
